{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法依身心障礙者權益保障法（以下簡稱本法）第八十八條第二項規定訂定之。","id":"D0070151/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"1ca044cd9a5f7325cf711b0b9da2b41c80472b223520d0643f6f33ac8d04652b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070151/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":36,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"建築物無障礙設備與設施改善基金（以下簡稱本基金）之管理及運用，除法令另有規定外，依本辦法之規定。","id":"D0070151/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"160ffb4c2fe6fd5b47535684a08ddc0e2471a2bd12ab9250056855ac1b5b789a","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070151/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":48,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"本基金為預算法第四條第一項第二款所定之特種基金，得以單位預算或附屬單位預算編列，並以直轄市、縣（市）政府為主管機關。","id":"D0070151/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"99e4e69379296f4d110412905414e3a47339f0bbe9f5c2d57fb189a29bb44632","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070151/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":58,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"本基金之來源如下：\n一、依本法第八十八條第一項所處之罰鍰收入。\n二、本基金之孳息收入。\n三、其他收入。","id":"D0070151/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"33c526ddd94406be143572ad8fe7b65d757cb418c61f294f997c22c3adce0379","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070151/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":51,"children":[{"id":"D0070151/a:4/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":10,"end":32,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070151/a:4/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":32,"end":44,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070151/a:4/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":44,"end":51,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"本基金之用途如下：\n一、辦理建築物無障礙設備與設施改善之費用，並優先使用於私有建築物改善。\n二、推廣建築物無障礙設備與設施之教育宣導及相關獎勵之費用。\n三、推動建築物無障礙設備與設施之研究發展費用。\n四、本基金之管理及行政費用。\n五、其他建築物無障礙設備與設施之相關費用。","id":"D0070151/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"478e0df6a0ee2c12be7198758cdb44f3748b78ce2fc87cd0375ec73d8773d60d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070151/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":136,"children":[{"id":"D0070151/a:5/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":10,"end":46,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070151/a:5/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":46,"end":76,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070151/a:5/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":76,"end":100,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070151/a:5/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":100,"end":115,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070151/a:5/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":115,"end":136,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"本基金應於公庫開立專戶存管。","id":"D0070151/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"ba693ef07ca545dc569fedb8daac87af0370e5061d01caf25f15b9ceb276b642","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070151/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":14,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":[],"text":"為管理及運用本基金，主管機關應設建築物無障礙設備與設施改善基金管理會（以下簡稱本會），置主任委員一人，由主管機關首長或由其指定相關主管兼任之，委員十二人至十四人，由主管機關就機關內及其他有關機關、身心障礙團體代表、專家學者聘兼之。","id":"D0070151/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"c7e31383d5a3218386e94816e1b32ccb44abe0c01c903acb8f4edf3d32ef68f6","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070151/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":115,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":[],"text":"本會置執行秘書一人，由主任委員指派業務主辦單位人員兼任，承主任委員之命綜理會務。幹事若干人，由主管機關就相關單位現職人員派兼之。","id":"D0070151/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"6576f322477a4f4922c0f050220f1c300676d1386fc2a2f1934328348d09bf50","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070151/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":64,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 9 條","path":[],"text":"本會之任務如下：\n一、本基金運用計畫之審議事項。\n二、本基金之管理及預算、決算之審議事項。\n三、本基金運用執行情形考核事項。\n四、其他有關事項。","id":"D0070151/a:9","anchor":"a-9","contentHash":"bde20c11d4d4ed167373d2f04af812506070caa3acd792581319367edccd53b7","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070151/a:9/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":72,"children":[{"id":"D0070151/a:9/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":9,"end":25,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070151/a:9/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":25,"end":46,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070151/a:9/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":46,"end":63,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070151/a:9/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":63,"end":72,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 10 條","path":[],"text":"本會每半年至少開會一次，必要時得召開臨時會議，由主任委員召集之，並得邀請有關人士列席。主任委員因事不能出席，由主任委員指定委員一人代理。","id":"D0070151/a:10","anchor":"a-10","contentHash":"b23f15e038780d302322216b5b543974d6bf337229c1985d3360f2b85f296433","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070151/a:10/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":68,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 11 條","path":[],"text":"本會委員及派兼人員均為無給職。但得依規定支給兼職交通費。","id":"D0070151/a:11","anchor":"a-11","contentHash":"0a94d5025d05621e084bb6e3580f83dee33f399b7cf5b5f355e11ab09bae45a4","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070151/a:11/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":28,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 12 條","path":[],"text":"本基金有關預算編製、執行及決算編報，應依預算法、會計法、決算法、審計法及相關法令規定辦理。","id":"D0070151/a:12","anchor":"a-12","contentHash":"30ba3657e0150c56e410a2f6a32a89e384294b5ba26d0cc77cd71c81fb96adfb","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070151/a:12/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":45,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 13 條","path":[],"text":"本基金會計事務之處理，應依規定訂定會計制度。","id":"D0070151/a:13","anchor":"a-13","contentHash":"eb3767087a0a837794b3e02720691238a800ba74446e7f396bf2a78c916a8a6c","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070151/a:13/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":22,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 14 條","path":[],"text":"本基金結束時，應予結算，其餘存權益應解繳公庫。","id":"D0070151/a:14","anchor":"a-14","contentHash":"494e24ca88a80228e036d1f3b178a42555fd6cb2736371ed630d593043d283d3","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070151/a:14/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":23,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 15 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法自發布日施行。","id":"D0070151/a:15","anchor":"a-15","contentHash":"47b8a3e12a88555780e2c610257366d820f6c2f5ed79aaf37d74ac3e56199b62","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070151/a:15/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":10,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國八十七年九月十五日內政部（87）台內營字第 8772774  號令\n  訂定發布全文 15 條\n2.中華民國八十八年七月三十一日內政部（88）台內營字第 8874010  號\n  令修正發布第 3、8、11 條條文\n3.中華民國九十七年五月一日內政部台內營字第 0970802995 號令修正發\n  布第 1、4 條條文\n4.中華民國一百零七年一月十九日內政部台內營字第 1070800252 號令修\n  正發布第 3、5、7、10  條條文","id":"D0070151","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2018-01-19","name":"建築物無障礙設備與設施改善基金收支保管及運用辦法","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0070151","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"06559117b3696125047bc0d0db3bf7fe69bbb4f95d5f48055d315f514a0fa60e","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2018-01-19","effectiveDate":""}}